 "notes": "5 provinces from the 2023 organic law, in force after the 2025 elections (governors sworn in ~4 Jul 2025). ISO 3166-2:BI still lists the 18 old provinces and has no codes for the new ones, so all 5 use CC-NAME codes. Old ISO codes are aliases of the province that took them over whole (BI-GI Gitega minus the Mahwa zone, which went to Burunga). BI-RM Rumonge (split Bujumbura/Burunga) and BI-MU Muramvya (split Bujumbura/Butanyerera/Gitega) have no single successor and are not aliased."
